and helpers. The exceptions are nxrecomp's adaptation files host.h, fs.h, input.h, input_sdl.h, ui/menu.h,
nvn_host.c and nvn_wsys.c. runtime/nvn_procs.inc comes from the same project. totk-pc-recomp adapted parts of this
code from MacNativeGames (https://github.com/ly05010419/MacNativeGames @ b75be8cf, Copyright (c) 2026 MacNativeGames
contributors; d2r_gfx by jhaizhou, origin d2r-mobile), and a few from LASRecomp (Copyright (c) 2026 Peiikai); each
file names its sources in its header. All of them are under the MIT License above.

